WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — rce-vc (30s) Narrator River

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.292
When ten coding agents edit different functions in the same file,

2
00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:07.332
line-based Git branches stall in merge conflicts.

3
00:00:07.752 --> 00:00:16.660
RCE-VC addresses semantic units by content rather than file lines: non-overlapping changes need zero coordination.

4
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.806
One Apple M5 Max core admits a submission

5
00:00:20.806 --> 00:00:26.441
against 100,000 units in 69.7 microseconds at 317 microjoules.

6
00:00:26.861 --> 00:00:33.549
Developers keep familiar Git commands while the repository enforces atomic admission and written refusal reasons.
